> and the fifth section of LfB? If not, You will need
> {.i mi puzi tcidu lo vomo'o jo'u lo mumo'o pe lyfyby.} instead.
> > .ije mi terpreti di'e

{vomoi} or {vomoi pagbu}. {vomo'o} is an indicator, not a selbri.

That still groups as (lo vomoi) jo'u (lo mumoi pe LFB). To get the
other grouping you need {vu'o}: {(lo vomoi jo'u lo mumoi) vu'o pe LFB}.

You could also join them at the brivla level:
{lo (vomoi jo'u mumoi) pagbu be LFB}

